  <item>
    <title>Vol.21 2026是新的2016吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69d79baeb977fb2c4783f036</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69d79baeb977fb2c4783f036</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 Apr 2026 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoXf3YGCykq7_5l92sn2dBLn7zzJ.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm1G1XcWAEH_HvE993wzJ5u6ICYV.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp_RXckIn8DVsFVlzyfG4BRXCkra.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrJNscYv3wXErjTIKrOypAHw8GSW.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmxlrORuG3YzSUYqDLUIxeTKLdcS.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnERghDR_a1OYbo_auXvGvvEFLQw.jpeg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjh8tUMx9iO-pzA_87nr9f_BmcCw.jpeg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhzsHWu9lamV4DH5Xax7bluUJuBZ.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhGcNfkDIStOYQa9Xh4ieYon2V-B.jpeg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FncraYJyF_YpoDeNQLO_kd6Ztbt1.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FklKBre_66vxBJ9yqPbbmAmzYsXL.jpeg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj-zKPGSmr0Pn1puzlcXG9KB2en1.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">01:35</a> This is what you came for: 所有人跟着音乐摇摆，享受夏夜的舞池，让我非常怀念</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="323">05:23</a> Don't let me down: 加拿大之旅的BGM&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="527">08:47</a> One dance: &nbsp;Drake巅峰时代的代表作之一</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="826">13:46</a> Heathens: 暗黑、叛逆，电影原声带的好听程度竟然超过了很多专辑里的歌&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1081">18:01</a> Let me love you: 电子音乐和流行音乐的完美跨界</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1341">22:21</a> Beautiful Now: 当下的美丽，那时的我却没有感受到</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1545">25:45</a> Self Control: 那个夏天已经逝去，我们都不再是曾经的自己</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1787">29:47</a> I'll show you: 音乐偶像的成长和脆弱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1971">32:51</a> Emotion: 漂浮在半空中的闪闪发光的执着</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2171">36:11</a> Starboy: 危险的性感，冰冷的魅力&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2401">40:01</a> Love is the future: 我们不知道明天会怎样，但至少我们有今晚</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2680">44:40</a> I took a pill in Ibiza: all I know is a sad song, a sad song...</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2770">46:10</a> I went back to Ibiza: all I know is a love song, a love song...</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3027">50:27</a> 2016年：人类情绪的各种美好都借由音乐井喷</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3107">51:47</a> 当我们在怀念2016年的时候，我们都在怀念什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3239">53:59</a> 过去已经过去，发现现在的美好，活在当下，或许就是最好的状态了，We beautiful now.</span></p><p><span>2026是新的2016吗？肯定不是，但或许当我们记住那些曾经的美好，专注活在当下，用音乐记录生活，定格瞬间。那么，2026就是新的2016。</span></p><p><strong><span>// The Nick FM Production @ 2026</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>欢迎订阅 The Nick FM.</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65fd7d9a2d9eae5d0a6e46d7/lkfmFKlhY2jdsmwn9gqOjIqFe6Vc.m4a" length="54001598" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:35</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkIB-ROVIp5yIb1M3Z5RHNzBoQpP.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.20 2025年度歌曲推荐：9首歌曲里的爱和忧伤</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/694f57172db086f8973185aa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">694f57172db086f8973185aa</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 28 Dec 2025 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo2xnrlM95BgEt9Ro6lToAnwHeWP.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmVGnoWYwAyqwqbIqZrrMfNhKLJi.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FozoxUTTSZtXKmsYWLxLz7dXV3iU.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Friox5CWYvAYiNEjZoxkU0WYGsEM.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkkLLuBQY5u1vVmDITLiWQiifJEM.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh7cWTDi7qU8kMCjyCMSAKHe9Za_.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhX2HXFAYMmjKy0nCXA3wLRwDDGV.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkBGhC0ZeC2vgX24q1EDaouL7KhP.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk1a1u0Xzv9ryy76aZb6Q1JqV_VI.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="309">05:09</a> 陈娴静 - Wui229 : 讲述和表达本身就是一种疗愈和力量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="515">08:35</a> 2025年最爱歌词：请让海浪校正我的听觉，请让眼泪洗净我的双眼，请让感觉再次回到我身边</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> Wolf Alice - The Sofa : 我真正做自己的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1136">18:56</a> Smerz - I got time and you got money : 想象中的完美爱情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> Fujii Kaze - Prema ：你就是爱本身</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1720">28:40</a> JADE - Plastic Box : 好听的pop应该是这样的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1785">29:45</a> 该如何面对有瑕疵的爱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1901">31:41</a> Nothing lasts forever</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a> 落日飞车 - Bluebird : 无论如何，我都愿朝你飞去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2390">39:50</a> FKA Twigs - Eusexua : 电子舞曲以一种叙事语言呈现出的精神连接</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2620">43:40</a> Eusexua - Harvest Sky 的丝滑过渡，你听出来了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2743">45:43</a> Oklou - Harvest Sky : 从热闹中抽离的快感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3113">51:53</a> Oklou - Choke Enough : 用温柔的方式去表达残酷的现实</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3205">53:25</a> 9首歌中的2025年 ：把痛苦做得更美，把爱做得更安全</span></p><span></span><p><span>这就是我们的2025年，一次次受伤，一次次痊愈，一次次告诉自己: what doesn't kill you make you stronger. 我们越来越相信音乐的疗愈的力量，我们也越来越明白：唯有热爱能抵岁月漫长。</span></p><span></span><p><span>愿我们选出的这9首歌能很好地总结2025年，也希望我们能一直有好的音乐相伴，共同走进2026年。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>// The Nick FM Production @ 2025</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎订阅 The Nick FM&nbsp;</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65fd7d9a2d9eae5d0a6e46d7/lvFTJQedeFZYiuBprzKyQ3my3umB.m4a" length="53816500" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn1m_lHRBaDrVxicNJ_IvYOzEakM.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.19 藤井风 Fujii Kaze: 灵性的、至高无上的爱</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/692d586c0d5237d4de5c548c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">692d586c0d5237d4de5c548c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 01 Dec 2025 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqjQSkpW_I9AFqrcVyXB5-FEwThI.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlmfexRG4e3VKX8Okpdko_ZTnUIe.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr1YLIdq27iIiFtBUU4yBVIRKlB2.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgDI6RWfBJ4LHFPZa2HS9JN6Rs7z.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsAnpgdtWEtX31fs4mqUdXWCRx7c.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqTcrebl_99VP4SpcnaGzCbEVfiw.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fph4ODjxgWn0VQXGWk2LJqVz2ycA.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmKpuYbiD9QbGidx3bx5Y9ZahrHn.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiQSHwDBEvLwzxRaaWaQ9zWf2tHd.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>FUJII KAZE，藤井风，这个用灵性书写音乐故事的年轻音乐人，用Help ever hurt never, love all serve all 和 Prema 这三张专辑让我们感受到了前所未有的爱和自由，听他的音乐产生的那种愉悦感就像你在运动时不断分泌的多巴胺，让你的嘴角禁不住地上扬，身体也不受控制地摆动，他的艺术就像他的名字一样，风，一种无形的力量，吹过每个人的耳边，吹进每个人的心间。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目Nick和Ivy聊聊这位充满灵性的艺术家，通过他的音乐，感受【至高无上的爱】慰藉每一个干涸的灵魂，治愈每一颗疲惫的心。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>// The Nick FM Productions @ 2025</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎订阅 The Nick FM</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65fd7d9a2d9eae5d0a6e46d7/lq04By0lxW7QWKUCQTe1ttokZxpY.m4a" length="48889530" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:20</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrlbCDQ4it6dxN4CfX7LNhRvsxsA.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.18 当我们在听【霉霉】Taylor Swift的时候Part 3: 艺术三部曲</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/690a1cc0aaf2588eb7f1bd11</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">690a1cc0aaf2588eb7f1bd11</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Nov 2025 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fny7mjNMnAluUIo08KCzB41QdIab.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgq510G1qRoP9HsIGuo11mr7JTIG.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjnUJthFg_hkLnIZWWrZbT1JHV7w.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjsVZGoOBOu52XsYLQokyRR5kxU3.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuputdkYUrE3_GXo3jf7ZG0ExMRO.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjgbFQ0e18_V6FR8aVG7XCHkXpiG.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【Folklore】,【Evermore】,【Midnights】这三张专辑，是Taylor Swift创作生涯中最为重要的阶段，更是在COVID-19疫情期间，影响最为深远的三张专辑，我们称为她的【艺术三部曲】</span></p><span></span><p><span>一切经历，皆为表达。在我们共同度过的那三年里，感到的孤独、迷茫、无奈和心碎，还有散落其中的脆弱的，短暂的美好，都被她记录在了这三张专辑中：无论是曲风转型之作，用音乐书写文学篇章的Folklore，还是更加走向内心，私人化程度极高的Evermore, 亦或是散落在她生命中的那十三个失眠的midnights，那些强烈的不安、焦虑和自嘲，都在向我们娓娓道来，一段又一段故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目依旧是和月半璇一起聊聊霉霉，聊聊这位“文学巨匠”是如何用音乐记录这段时期的自己和世界的。</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>愿你能听完这段故事，无论你在哪里，在干什么，和我们一起，complete this era.</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>// The Nick FM Productions @ 2025</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎订阅 The Nick FM&nbsp;</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65fd7d9a2d9eae5d0a6e46d7/lv9TavgvW7GbILQEDOkd-TpkT1D8.m4a" length="85144273" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrkrFCgCKEVZ8iGt8dDM54zG1nF-.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.17 【Fuji Rock】富士摇滚音乐节：自然、音乐、无尽夏</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68adc58742cc2798e78aee09</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68adc58742cc2798e78aee09</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Aug 2025 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmxii55UJ_TL_PPKeKxOfBIeB1c9.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpHZ5AHHBG_WpAbPsRCgUAtfVd9S.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoYkWsRO2DtfvFb8HWHZn_kasEER.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk3ObvcLMiY3eTzm_rBoyR9j0uuW.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhHLPdql5z5-7StwUs5nPmwr5UFk.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoWorX8VAkETBgnrkPdDB9btPYJD.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FofPmwiAVmzZ7XhYtdqu27HIRuxS.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuu4-Mzin7brIJeuC2X25crGOnn2.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqcMVu7ZOF2jm0EiFxpUX7Q2vGy0.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiBdPHq-i48nKrFAi13KBpXt3BQU.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk7CJSnr-D2fAJBoq6nvYjntCnQ1.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiqaVSohNE1hPWv-irGj2awKy3vH.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpehjG81xS4pRVj8bUkpGmA3UbDf.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkKxgQntkuT3ofa_sa0WTG20dVny.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>夏天，音乐，自然。能把这三种元素融合在一起的音乐节可能就是FUJI ROCK了，在盛夏赴一场庆祝生命的狂欢，来一次“身体在炼狱，眼睛和耳朵在天堂”的极限体验，感受野性的纯粹的美，这才是我们的【无尽夏】</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目Nick和Ivy一起聊聊富士摇滚音乐节，希望你听到我们的节目，就好像身临其境一般，到了现场，重拾对音乐的热爱，重新获得年轻的力量。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>// The Nick FM Productions @ 2025</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎订阅 The Nick FM</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65fd7d9a2d9eae5d0a6e46d7/lj-QNEcSVt4r2i7rW7ukuro1Plzr.m4a" length="61332309" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:42:15</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftw4sh3fI8VhwigOlZgqUVl7x6Z_.png"/>
