  <item>
    <title>Vol.16 当我们在听【霉霉】Taylor Swift的时候Part 2 : 复仇三部曲</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6860c49bbef90978ec6b3719</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6860c49bbef90978ec6b3719</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 02 Jul 2025 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn3vbvcOt-Uq3ZruemCerWOuQC7U.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu-9rdzBGi8Pi211gLiaJzL8oH6B.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh6bQTn5karG6RBTgXfKKIAalbmC.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvJ_FdQUlrN1Man1f1j1qD6rbsKi.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpMZtqexbQNQOqnr4l1ThESXUEBF.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FncRnaIsT0DzemGjs1jCJzmniTMj.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrxeSF4My9630gAYwnTuzybXGqWH.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【1989】,【Reputation】,【Lover】三张专辑，又是三次蜕变，是属于Taylor Swift的【复仇三部曲】，面对外界的质疑，面对他人的非议，霉霉开始重建自己的价值体系，她要成为怎样的自己？她该如何面对人性的善与恶？她该如何开始她的“复仇”？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目我们继续聊聊Taylor Swift，聊聊这位“黑化”的全球音乐偶像是如何穿过黑暗的隧道，迎接尽头的微光的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="12">00:12</a> Intro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 1989：霉霉pop流行乐的巅峰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="589">09:49</a> Blank Space: 用别人伤害自己的方式去伤害别人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a> 情感想通：有经历过就能共鸣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1030">17:10</a> 霉霉的复仇：你说我坏，我表现得更坏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1246">20:46</a> 艺术家生存困境：不得不去迎合大众审美</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> Reputation: 霉霉彻底“黑化”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1810">30:10</a> 霉霉的暗黑人格：当时的她非常需要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1948">32:28</a> 霉霉的复仇：不要再做一个good girl</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2063">34:23</a> Delicate: 脆弱的，极度需要被爱的霉霉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2364">39:24</a> Lover: 叛逆，温柔的复仇？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2585">43:05</a> Lover: 巨大创伤后的疗愈&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2682">44:42</a> Daylight: 爱的具象化的体现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2810">46:50</a> 善良有才华的艺术家：爱，都在细节里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2973">49:33</a> 复仇的第一层意义：宣泄不满的情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3080">51:20</a> 复仇的第二层意义：自我和解，和过去说再见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3188">53:08</a> 复仇的终极意义：成为更强大的自己&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3228">53:48</a> 对待外界的评价：haters gonna hate but you are what you love.</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3390">56:30</a>【复仇三部曲】终章</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3446">57:26</a> Outro</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>// The Nick Productions @ 2025</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎订阅 The Nick FM</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65fd7d9a2d9eae5d0a6e46d7/lg33WdkCYx-yfCcP2Xk-rbg10B2b.m4a" length="85294313" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:46</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvVvrIyyfL9FKPl-2tw_Hr7vOcZ-.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.15 当我们在听【霉霉】Taylor Swift的时候Part 1：成长三部曲</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6834844138dcc57c64136c45</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6834844138dcc57c64136c45</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 01 Jun 2025 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjrvTPzR6Oz8_9hM17BBmYdcD7mj.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkPVGcg5ufgkMODJ4QeW0oq0Z_0X.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsRyFyhbhaNKOxwE_kfml8pheaC9.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrU3C42MUZiUTwazxtGA6d7Ut3w3.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【Fearless】, 【Speak Now】, 【Red】 三张专辑，三次蜕变，是属于Taylor Swift的一部【成长三部曲】，而当我们现在回听她的这三张专辑时，我们到底在听什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目我非常高兴能请到月半璇，能和这么一位热爱音乐的霉霉粉聊聊这位流行女王，是很快乐的事情，希望你也喜欢我们的这期节目！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="12">00:12</a> Intro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="173">02:53</a> 青涩和梦幻的Love Story+You Belong with Me</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="707">11:47</a> 对妈妈的爱该怎么说出口？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1151">19:11</a> 初听【Speak Now】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1374">22:54</a> Long Live：How I hope they shine</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1654">27:34</a> 少女的情窦初开，对爱情的真诚期待和追逐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1958">32:38</a> 私人化的恋爱经历和公众化的表达，如何平衡？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> Mean: haters gonna hate.</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2225">37:05</a> 我们该不该有负能量？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2558">42:38</a> Red:"乡村"包围"城市"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2671">44:31</a> All Too Well: 霉霉歌曲TOP ONE?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3528">58:48</a>“随着我听霉霉的歌越来越深入，我发现自己不懂的单词越来越多。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3618">1:00:18</a> 从形式到内容，好的艺术家都在不断地精进和打磨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3725">1:02:05</a> "You are what you love."</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3800">1:03:20</a> 【成长三部曲】终章</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">1:05:00</a> Outro</span></p><span></span><p><span>Follow 月半璇：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：月半的一百年</span></p><span></span><p><span>网易云音乐：月半璇子X</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>// The Nick Productions @ 2025</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎订阅 The Nick FM</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65fd7d9a2d9eae5d0a6e46d7/lpUFOjZDETYR_HVOEhjEwjsFkSUt.m4a" length="95970485" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmp9_Jr05g26fqBbyixR6_fpHzrS.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.14 LÜCY：我向往自由的彼岸，也渴望回家的路</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/681617ab6970cc7b4d8067d9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">681617ab6970cc7b4d8067d9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 04 May 2025 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn4Jeo3Us3lr8Z2-3ukC_JANbooV.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgRYOhrPhzEHLr77k9OtIdV19O8m.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkB06GAtH_Npreo-7GRg39bOLKbs.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frb7VG6qC4BuXCDl5ViSZ-PBGuro.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvPgiPDqq9b5KLqY3I64StpfJfxK.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiIjMkLOiVDw7mkmZvjsKC5Tx4tl.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnxArlyaFcP1AIK4X6kgN6exLaDm.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvWLQjpRKh8w9fYhCD1NJZQmJM0H.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>LÜCY创作的歌曲融合了bedroom pop, ambient, folk, melodic house以及post-rock等不同的风格，很难被定义，就像她在歌曲中一以贯之的对自由的追求，热烈、率性、洒脱。扎根于对生命本身的尊重，对自然的敬畏，以及对神灵的敬仰，这个充满灵性的00后音乐艺术家，总是在用她的艺术告诉我们：虽然这趟生命之旅并不顺利，挫折和痛苦常常来袭，但我们还是需要勇敢地面对，从更高的视角看待生活，努力找到自己真正的热爱和内心的平静。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目Nick和Ivy带你聆听LÜCY的音乐，带你踏上一段从沙漠到陆地，从森林到海洋的【不被定义的】旅行。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">02:05</a> LÜCY音乐初体验：自然、灵动、神秘、生命力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="248">04:08</a> 电线杆上的鸟：2023年3月的回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="573">09:33</a> Trick or Trip: &nbsp;We trippin'</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="755">12:35</a> LÜCY第一张专辑的概念：动物性的精神之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="985">16:25</a> Isahini: "现在，孩子，请听来自山脉所传递的话，当太阳西下"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a> OH HEY: 巡演现场最high的一首歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1509">25:09</a> 热爱与坚持：无法停歇，特别强烈的创作欲和表达欲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1733">28:53</a> LÜCY第二张专辑的概念：植物性的海洋畅游</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1985">33:05</a> 风 ( ༄ )：具有灵性的自然力量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a> Fresh: 恋爱如养花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2162">36:02</a> Dance on the Shoreline: 如呼吸一般自然</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2417">40:17</a> &nbsp;声(せい)：Mono no aware 无常是常，享受当下&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2817">46:57</a> With all My Heart: 喜欢音乐就像喜欢一个人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2966">49:26</a> 自己与他人：认清自己才能更好地包容他人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3096">51:36</a> LÜCY的音乐对00后们的意义</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>// The Nick FM Productions @ 2025</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎订阅 The Nick FM</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65fd7d9a2d9eae5d0a6e46d7/lo_rqrauIRU8DkBL754uGmM_lOJu.m4a" length="80965245" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:47</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FokJO3njBKPXSzgU2HByIj3Y0jVg.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.13 方大同：人生如一阵春风</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67dfa63778103db3bd4b20aa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67dfa63778103db3bd4b20aa</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Mar 2025 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqH69uoVCxKLmpTQSJskbE-yFRi_.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmNZX-qHsCt6OToOP9gtCFaNqem2.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fplxnv4HMKk51V-WCXDZul5ouN4R.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvDpf5uMHiFGHuYm7indfw9NUKOr.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiAHZ6128YQ7qQAmrtqb3-ykyKVf.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnBUSM6wZXqhyXU0cPwIK-GzwKd2.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmDP6hRycaadSNO-G5nfWt7CFb2h.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo5bOsYRMoc9LS0nSpvYFLweak2l.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgG3zhWw7s_0HITZHqopNymuPpf_.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlmrSu_aCEFyJ2vTq68894v324n2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>当我们在怀念方大同的时候，我们在怀念什么？这位把R&amp;B、Soul音乐风格带入华语音乐的音乐人，不仅因为他的才华而让我们欣赏，更因为他对音乐的热爱、对身边人的真诚而让我们感动。他用自己的行动证明：人生如一阵春风，要给自己，给他人带来温暖和希望。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目Nick和Ivy一起聊聊方大同，在他带给我们的每一首歌里，向这位德才兼备的艺术家致敬。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>// The Nick FM Productions @ 2025</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎订阅 The Nick FM</span></strong></p>]]></description>
