    <guid isPermaLink="false">67a1f1d2d74435e4a30ab50e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 04 Feb 2025 15:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FocZBAxXtTG9GX-4SA-q7WEXv6O3.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtFlItnfj3UBmPsSRp_JxAYi7WQa.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj1PGnmSkmU4zUn1TxnQ5sjuuMXD.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvxIK1fnWrN66ly63UHuWoim9fEP.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu8NHli7ZLHoRRiHxAfY-DHQQuGg.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtSHWebbPm_FBzFKjN6SexPOnYbM.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>当我们在听The Weeknd的Hurry Up Tomorrow这张专辑的时候，我们究竟听到了什么？未来，快来！是不是也是对我们现在瞬息万变、世事无常、一切都有可能发生的科技时代的某种隐喻？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目Nick和Ivy带你一起聆听这张专辑，去感受The Weeknd所描述的黑暗、恐惧、死亡、怀疑、毁灭、疗愈和救赎，so, hurry up!&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐曲目：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Wake Me Up</span></p><span></span><p><span>Baptized In Fear</span></p><span></span><p><span>Open Hearts</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Abyss</span></p><span></span><p><span>Without a Warning</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hurry Up Tomorrow</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>// The Nick FM Productions @ 2025</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎订阅 The Nick FM</span></strong></p>]]></description>
