  <item>
    <title>Vol.10 跟我们一起逃离这里吧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/676583de1e823e72d378073e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">676583de1e823e72d378073e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Dec 2024 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrKR_Cz2W3lXsh0R9G4KjDvuVttM.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr4lMND5i2hZd0ZA57rUA1cFUrm4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgjDIn-Cl9mArL-BjmFYGCGJn6D9.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fthv2qJVpkLVXcx4qV7YTfbXyyaG.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpN-pRrpkg-9CuxqtXHkx5W3AB8U.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs2TMe66zQ4WmlSI_GCW89UHH2Rp.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk6J6y-9dCyh3ESJG7bdiu8SsKex.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>如果说逃离是离开一个让你厌倦、讨厌的地方，到达一个让你向往、渴望的地方，那么听喜欢的音乐就是一种逃离，听喜欢的podcast也是一种逃离，做喜欢做的事更是一种逃离，在那个地方，你感到慰藉，感到被疗愈，感到平静与祥和；在那个地方，你可以真实坦诚地做自己，直面自己的平凡与伟大，善良与邪恶；在那个地方，你能感受到生命的力量，感到爱感到自由。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目Nick和Ivy带你一起去感受这6首歌的力量，它们能带我们去到的地方，也一定是你想去的地方，希望你在听完我们这期节目后，也找到内心的平静和喜悦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐曲目：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Dark &amp; Handsome - Blood Orange</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hymn for the Weekend - Coldplay</span></p><span></span><p><span>My Love Mine all Mine - Mitski</span></p><span></span><p><span>Polarize - Twenty One Pilots</span></p><span></span><p><span>Run Away with Me - Carly Rae Jepsen</span></p><span></span><p><span>Polaris - Deadmau5</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>// The Nick FM Production @ 2024</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎订阅 The Nick FM</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpx4mXN8irahSc2sHzud3vOkb-3R.m4a" length="108847905" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:15:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn_vXYXRShrQWoDpkgqRjK72_nhw.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
