  <item>
    <title>Vol.09 Charli XCX的Brat到底是一张怎样的专辑？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/672b4d986c53cd405a675481</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">672b4d986c53cd405a675481</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 10 Nov 2024 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrV__zLW5Anp-fR1kUu7rYauir55.webp"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg6gadfcYKcND-98uu4acOnCDH-w.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvTP6nPMTg4zpJKoKx7Rs2hJMNyW.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkz2SJO70pqFE5BigJ-AgdOpT8MT.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpBIuFwvVBHXENLbrf9jcVCwm37M.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoLiLhwqSGYfIArTdBQxyfuQpq9n.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlzXwSUlxJ1LN4gbF3I7OGAXI04z.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fte-RkjKz726Ybh1MOE66VdQ8GBZ.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>Charli XCX的Brat到底是一张怎样的专辑？它怎么能够引起全世界乐迷meme病毒式的效仿？这种被定义了“叛逆”的史莱姆绿色像病毒一样疯狂地传播，从艺术到商业，从平民百姓到政界大咖，无远弗届。Brat到底有怎样的魔力？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目Nick和Ivy带你一起潜入Charli XCX创造的Brat世界，去听一听同时兼具叛逆、酷炫、迷乱和脆弱的情绪表达的背后，这张专辑到底想要向我们传达什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐曲目：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Everything is Romantic</span></p><span></span><p><span>I Might Say Something Stupid</span></p><span></span><p><span>Girl, So Confusing</span></p><span></span><p><span>So I</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>// The Nick FM Productions @ 2024</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎订阅 The Nick FM</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmqU9rCUI7zRf5kzSdE9mVbqoM0q.m4a" length="93303837" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:04:17</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgS073JuWRRcEroRkDHWDar-Zkrh.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.08 Billie Eilish: Birds of a Feather</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671118a8db2cf82757fe90be</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671118a8db2cf82757fe90be</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 19 Oct 2024 02:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvYkIZerGKSvi9ED7_zi67Gjq6Qq.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkmbDdR0MG8HwVOCpHgyNOldcQkb.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhi0pYlzgXmnqdWIDdnxPY2SzkAJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Birds of a feather flock togther. 有同样羽毛的人，注定是要在一起的。对于爱，Billie Eilish今年夏天用Birds of a feather这首歌做了最好的表达：我们都如此渴望，想找到那个和我们同频共振的人，或许这样的爱人根本不存在，或许我们的爱根本无法打败时间，但只是单纯地去追逐挚爱，也足以让我们潸然泪下了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目Nick带着我们一起聆听Billie Eilish的这首birds of a feather. 一起来听听这首歌是怎么唤起我们刻在心底的那个名字，是怎么让我们重拾追爱的勇气，为了ta，千千万万遍。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>// The Nick FM Productions @ 2024</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎订阅 The Nick FM</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnzSMkgR48UySZBim65syr3lV7-w.m4a" length="25056001" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:17:15</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnyif4dX63h9J7AJv16uBC3Tjwws.png"/>
